; “yard”
: Used in {{lang|zh|《英吉利国舆情记略》}} (1834), probably a derivation of "counting chip" sense which is used for translating English [[yard]].
; “kilometer per hour”
: Probably a corruption of {{zh-l|邁}} (mile > mile per hour > kilometer per hour).
